== Notes ==
*The caster suffers 5 [[magical damage]] for casting the spell.
* When cast with [[maximize spell]], the die roll is incorrectly set to 8 (instead of 32).
*The damage applied to undead is actually [[negative energy damage]] (a bug).
*On normal [[difficulty setting]] and easier, curative spells cast on a [[player character]] are automatically maximized, or double the constant part (+1 per caster level) if already maximized.

